 sinks), which needs a reservoir simulation; this model gives them the same pressures, so it cannot rank them\", \"5,000 more designs drawn across the space by Latin hypercube (doublets, depth, flow cap, every unit's size, the gas mode), each run for a year as drawn: 1,633 meet every cap, the rest break one (kept, on the Compare tab's map); the 6 best feasible ones, each unit shrunk while every cap held, joined the candidates\"]}}", "role": "tool"}

